{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14795","headline":"奉和圣制麟德殿宴百僚 · 卢纶","name":"奉和圣制麟德殿宴百僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云辟御筵张，山呼圣寿长。\n玉栏丰瑞草，金陛立神羊。\n台鼎资庖膳，天星奉酒浆。\n蛮夷陪作位，犀象舞成行。\n网已祛三面，歌因守四方。\n千秋不可极，花发满宫香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}